$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/text
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 10

plain text

$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/sum
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 9

2 + 3 = 5

$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/page
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8
content-length: 19

<p>an HTML page</p>

$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/created
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 7

made it

$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/no-cache
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
cache-control: no-store
content-length: 16

fresh every time

$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/by-hand
HTTP/1.1 202 Accepted
x-note: built by hand
content-length: 6

queued
